{"id":"455291","name":"竹荪龙骨汤","author":"凤记美食","authorId":"10609838","desc":"","cover":"images/455291/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"竹荪干品","amount":"60克"}],"sub":[{"name":"猪龙骨","amount":"300克"},{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"150克"},{"name":"姜","amount":"1小块"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"少许"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"干竹荪放入水中浸泡10分钟。","img":"images/455291/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"清洗干净，去除网状部分。","img":"images/455291/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"白萝卜去皮，切滚刀块。","img":"images/455291/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"龙骨斩件，清洗干净。","img":"images/455291/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把龙骨、竹荪、白萝卜、姜放入放入电压力煲里，加入适量水。","img":"images/455291/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盖上盖调至煲汤。","img":"images/455291/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"时间到打开盖，加入盐、鸡精、胡椒粉调味。","img":"images/455291/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盛入碗中开始享受美食。","img":"images/455291/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}